on't come out - and they do whatever it takes to keep their sexuality a secret. This series shows one story among many of Arab queers living this life.","rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"8464763969943783488","title":"Tri koraka u prazno","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"1958","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/09/ace4dde71a50449ea7718093e4794555.jpg","description":"A boatman who worked for others all his life gets into smuggling of luxury watches so he could earn enough for old age. A girl he loves and money is all that he wants, yet one dawn separates him from his dream...","rating":"8.3","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 26m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"4128741417105640368","title":"Every Breath U Take","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2026","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2026/02/09/4e6a96217abfc21ca19fc4a4d08ce23c.jpg","description":"Majoy (Angelica Panganiban) is a hopeless romantic who believes that when cliché romantic moments happen in real life, it’s a sign she’ll find the one. When it happens to her, it’s with Leo (Piolo Pascual), who happens to not be a one-woman guy. Released in 2012 and directed by Mae Cruz-Alviar.\n\nStarring Angelica Panganiban, Piolo Pascual, Ryan Bang, Wendy Valdez, Ryan Eigenmann, and Ketchup Eusebio.\n\nDISCLAIMER: Due to music restrictions, some parts of this movie were rescored for this YouTube upload version.\n\nSubscribe to the ABS-CBN Star Cinema channel! - \nhttp://bit.ly/ABSCBNStarCinema\n\nFor the latest movie, news, trailers & exclusive interviews visit our official website http://starcinema.abs-cbn.com\n\nWant to watch NEW movies right at home? Head to ktx.ph now!\n\nAnd connect with us in our Social pages:\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/StarCinema\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/starcinema\nInstagram: http://instagram.