 as big as the universe, fast as lightning or slow as evolution, you will get something amazing! Really surprising! So try not to get too excited, try not to laugh and shout very loudly, because what you are about to see is something that you have not seen before. Welcome ... this is the Dr. W Show! Dr. Woody Bonepecker, aka Dr. W, is a delirious doctor who is always looking for the truth of the natural facts of everyday life. He is the presenter of a TV program, and in each episode he will explain to the audience different phenomena in his particular, ironic and hilarious style. Dr. W is really stubborn, he is not afraid of anything and will do anything necessary to get to the bottom of things. In his show, Dr. W uses all kinds of resources to present and explain the topics. Not only does he perform crazy experiments as a good scientist, he also appeals to the most absurd humor as if he were a clown, or to the most fantastic magic as if he were a magician. Dr. W also has the help of special guests in many episodes, as well as an enormous variety of characters that appear to help him in the development of each theme. Likewise, the live audience has a fundamental role, as it reacts to the explanations of Dr. W at all times.","rating":"6.3","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"3698352863316427848","title":"\"FALSE REAP\" w/ Joseph Watson","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2021","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2026/03/08/c2855b027022981d04322098dd6272e5.jpg","description":"Joseph Watson, formerly known as Baby Joe instructs how he enters into leg attacks using what is known as the \"false reap\". A very tricky and unforeseen entry when an opponent is using a knee slice or combat base. Always on the mend of evolving techniques, Joe is an incredible athlete and an even better teacher.","rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[{"quality":"360p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/37b17ff79f5ca28b8cb2b9575ab722b3.mp4?sign=749b76113ffb1634846ea052578791f8&t=1795680321","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"8677622","season":0,"episode":0},{"quality":"360p","url":"https://bcdn4.hakunaymatata.com/resource/37b17ff79f5ca28b8cb2b9575ab722b3.mp4?sign=749b76113ffb1634846ea052578791f8&t=1795680321","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"8677622","headers":{"Referer":"https://sportslive.wine","User-Agent":"com.community.oneroom/50020119 (Linux; U; Android 11; en_US; M2012K11AG; Build/RP1A.200720.011; Cronet/135.0.7012.3)"},"season":null,"episode":null}],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"886954072107009104","title":"Twarza w twarz","type":"series","category":"series","year":"2007","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/10/28d26101ee6050940f520616c4241621.jpg","description":"Face can be altered the same as the identity. However, past remains unchanged. Sometimes you try to get away from it but sooner or later you will have to face what happened in order to rebuild your life. Victor 'Dragonfly' is a highly skilled thief. He is shot in face during a police action in which a policeman dies. Dragonfly becomes prime suspect. Because of being chased by the police Victor escapes abroad. Thanks to his friend, Baker, he lands in Swiss plastic surgery clinic run by professor Michalski. His daughter Martha, a talented plastic surgeon, undertakes Dragonfly's face surgery. During two years she conducts series of operations to change Victor's face. Martha is not aware of her patient's past and she falls in love with him reciprocally. Dragonfly wants to start a new, honest life with beloved woman. However, their plans are ruined by Victor's past. He returns to Poland in order to clear himself of a charge of murder. Martha is familiarized with the criminal past of the man she loves. She starts doubting in his innocence...","rating":"5.2","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"8381379808411959248","title":"Herbert. Barbarzynca w ogrodzie","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2021","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/11/663b8afb42fd21a2162d61d5e76f9c3b.jpg","description":"Polish author Zbigniew Herbert is one of the most remarkable poets of the 20th century. His works have been translated into 40 languages, acclaimed and awarded around the world, mainly because of its timeless and universal dimension. In Poland, his significance is even greater, as Herbert was a moral guide in his native country. His poetry was of great importance during the fight against communism. Many Poles learned his poems by heart and remember them up to this day. However, behind the crystalline beauty of his poetry, there is a man struggling with everyday life. His story told by his wife, Katarzyna, and people who were close to him unveils a picture of a unique, yet complex artist. A model of intelligence, humor and charm, on the one hand, Herbert has been struggling with anger, physical pain and mental illness, on the other.","rating":"6.0","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 35m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"842995545688918008","title":"Your World w/ Neil Cavuto","type":"series","category":"series","year":"1996","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/09/6be7da0879eb6013b4246a149f1d99a4.jpg","description":"Business news and analysis.","rating":"4.8","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"8777824118969384912","title":"Kamen Rider W","type":"series","category":"series","year":"2009","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2026/01/27/13a6d9877e92c01a50d1cc7e64a80abd.jpg","description":"After an abundance of Gaia Memory related crimes in Fuuto, the self-proclaimed hard-boiled detective, Shotaro Hidari and the mysterious Phillip team up