n, how, and where they receive that care. The Care They've Earned tells the stories of six veterans, but it highlights the struggles of finding adequate health care that all veterans face. It educates about the opportunity that more choices could mean for our veterans to receive the care they need - when and where they need it.","rating":"7.6","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"4h 0m","season_count":0,"streams":[{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/e8dc06ddcd1a8099c53175e03dc56014.mp4?sign=d403ef8803180ef11f552aa86e4fd5a3&t=1795690306","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"125265288","season":null,"episode":0},{"quality":"720p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/e95d53dd164f31e6218b8708f3df3c5e.mp4?sign=21016981bb37fd2098ac8e934c8b51ab&t=1795690306","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"125265288","season":null,"episode":0},{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn4.hakunaymatata.com/resource/e8dc06ddcd1a8099c53175e03dc56014.mp4?sign=d403ef8803180ef11f552aa86e4fd5a3&t=1795690306","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"125265288","headers":{"Referer":"https://sportslive.wine","User-Agent":"com.community.oneroom/50020119 (Linux; U; Android 11; en_US; M2007J20CG; Build/RP1A.200720.011; Cronet/135.0.7012.3)"},"season":null,"episode":null},{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/e8dc06ddcd1a8099c53175e03dc56014.mp4?sign=d2be127cbaa639f22637bf105da899d4&t=1795686758","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"125265288","season":null,"episode":0},{"quality":"720p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/e95d53dd164f31e6218b8708f3df3c5e.mp4?sign=a702f374d2620b28007d00d2e0fc3812&t=1795686758","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"125265288","season":null,"episode":0}],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"5391415699950784304","title":"Robot Taekwon V vs. Goldwing","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"1978","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2026/03/30/f96bc523fc835db2b2480ab3b2e31f96.jp