e who prefer \"rock\" music. Through interviews and an array of musical settings the film explores the young people's feelings in a humorist yet serious manner, bringing to the forefront issues of biases and national identity inherent in this innocent yet very powerful form of social entertainment. Includes musical performances by Gilberto Santa Rosa, El Gran Combo, REO Speedwagon and others.","rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"4h 0m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"2249755802242285632","title":"Martes y trece","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"1962","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/09/a5c71339ab5ccaceba53de5b2d9eaeab.jpg","description":"Lola and Maria are two Spanish young ladies engaged to Franz and Pepe, all so eager to spend their honeymoon that the moment seems never to come, as all sorts of problems pave their way.","rating":"4.2","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 25m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"1237847814948930384","title":"Vas-y Coupe!","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2020","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/10/8e6e4951f64d627dbe7e252e31d0c371.jpg","description":"A motley crew of laborers makes the yearly trek to a vineyard in France's Champagne region to pick grapes for a famed winemaker, but as his son begins to take the reins it is unclear if this harvest tradition can endure. A pure vérité portal into two disparate French worlds entwined.","rating":"8.3","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 32m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"5511942806840952544","title":"Oscuro y Lucientes","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2018","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/13/dc8c24bdceedb497dcaee03541352b13.jpg","description":"Goya's body remained forgotten in a pantheon in Bordeaux. Decades later, everyone present at the exhumatio