 about growing up, love, friendship and heroism. The warm but suspenseful and occasionally spine-chilling film focuses on what happens in the today's world when technology stops working and the 'primal' human instincts come to light.","rating":"6.9","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 23m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"7777378213978063952","title":"Doktori z Pocátku","type":"series","category":"series","year":"2013","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/12/5c7fa83dfd2f831ddb12a6063feab313.jpg","description":null,"rating":"2.2","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"6481804644854417632","title":"Modré z nebe","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"1997","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/09/de706323683ffa2fee0143ffd44694a3.jpg","description":"Three generations of women living in the same household, trying to get along with their different priorities of life.","rating":"6.1","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 43m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"6595292344369959432","title":"DRAGON BALL Z KAKAROT Gameplay Walkthrough  - No Commentary","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2024","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2026/02/10/77c05b1887065ea7176946557097b326.jpg","description":"Dragon Ball Z Kakarot Walkthrough Part 1 and until the last part will include the full Dragon Ball Z Kakarot Gameplay on PS5. This Dragon Ball Z Kakarot Gameplay is recorded in 4K 60FPS on PS5 and will include the full game, all endings and all boss fights. \n\nEnjoy! \n\nIf you liked the video please remember to leave a Like & Comment, I appreciate it a lot!\n\nDragon Ball Z: Kakarot is an action role-playing game developed by CyberConnect2 and published by Bandai Namco Entertainment, based on the Dragon Ball franchise. Relive the story of Goku and other Z Fighters in DR