878226002858705112","language":"Urdu dub","label":"Urdu dub"}]},{"id":"8683494817399194448","title":"Being Captain Zero","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2009","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/11/6a707b8eef30219253553546ca893378.jpg","description":"This is a dynamic documentary about two 1970s era marijuana smugglers who were forced to separate when they got too successful. Nothing could prepare them for what they saw when they reunited 20 years later. Based on the best selling book 'In search of Captain Zero'. Shot in 3 countries with beautiful production value.","rating":"6.5","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 8m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"1245852208059533304","title":"Will to Power","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2008","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/09/ce539d88d8158a675a7f0e332bc9653e.jpg","description":"The film \"Will to Power\" is the story of redemption and two best friends (Jason and Erik) who end up planning a murder that goes anything but right. Kathryn is the 'innocent' target of the murder plan and in the end Jason proves to be one of the darkest characters in the film and represents the underlying theme to never underestimate anyone.","rating":"7.3","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 30m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"1362928206185152464","title":"Lords of the Underworld","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2007","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/09/53a8d660fc735543077b0b95bc73a765.jpg","description":"Mafia boss Rocky Basta is a man of vast ambition who rules his dark empire with an iron fist. He plans to consolidate his power with that of his enemies to form a new world order. Instead of constantly going to war Rocky proposes a gladiatorial forum in which power is earned; respect won or lost, and disputes are resolved;..until death. \"Gentlemen we have always lived by the sword, might is right. I propose that we set up a game to the death. A game of real power and strength. A game that centuries ago decided the fate of nations...\" It's the fascinating story of a man, who has a vision to unify the Underworld. His past sins torment his very being. Guardians of the 'game', protectors from ancient times, offer their guidance, yet their motives are unknown. Rocky is put to the test facing a past love, a troubled daughter he never knew, the dark underworld syndicates challenging his power, and the onus that it exacts. And this is only the beginning.","rating":"5.9","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 33m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"5799327933428842448","title":"SP Zero 15","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2016","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/10/c5ef50c527bdd89821b4bf874e19f998.jpg","description":"15 directors telling 15 tales about Sao Paulo","rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 22m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"4322832801151206480","title":"Alibi.com 2","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2023","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2026/01/26/42304a7bdd79b5aff99d0a1b8090b07b.jpg","description":"Greg's life had been pretty quiet after the agency closed, until he decides to propose to Flo and has to introduce her to his crooked father and ex-actress mother. With no choice but to reopen the agency and find fake parents.","rating":"6.5","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 28m","season_count":0,"streams":[{"quality":"360p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/f8e9ab029dcf46989bf2c5a6e09ceb59.mp4?sign=62b6057a5b2f319e284f8059b6beefd1&t=1795690719","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"222400704","season":null,"episode":0},{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/04ce941d780a8989c0c3b1d1d5dd8655.mp4?sign=761080ebfb