:"movie","category":"movies","year":"2015","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/12/04b929cc7e8a2bfc6e90e159b3e1bf9c.jpg","description":"While Saint Nicholas and Black Pete sail to Belgium on their steamboat, horse caretaker Ramon drives the horse on land to prevent sea sickness.","rating":"6.1","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 45m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"5554379780964894944","title":"Ons geluk","type":"series","category":"series","year":"1995","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/09/f608c2c3e71d992b00221568a787460d.jpg","description":"The script of this relatively prestigious Flemish TV series was composed by Paul Koeck, himself a Flemish novelist, from several books of his colleague Gerard Walschap, one of which provided the title, Dutch for 'Our happiness', but the story is definitely not one of bliss. The main protagonist is René Hox, a fine and talented young man, son of two uncultivated rag-pickers who keeps their name even though he's adopted by the generous wealthy brewer Door Onckeloms who puts him trough university as his prospective heir; René however chooses to follow his inclination to the arts. His over-developed social conscience soon gets him in conflict with the conservative elite, and things don't improve when he falls in love with Leontien Verstraeten, a ruthless libertarian. There are many other story-lines involving various other characters, most of which end up seeing their apparent good fortune squashed by life.","rating":"7.1","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"7067883426661449680","title":"Kiekens","type":"series","category":"series","year":"2010","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/11/667adbf618692693f17e17a65a6a5e7b.jpg","description":"Teacher Raymond Kiekens is the vice-principal in a Flemish high-school, where the lazy principal Savoy 'delegates' all the work to him. Bad-tempered cynic Kiekens despises all fellow staff and the pupils, yet mostly works out his frustrations most cruelly on his administrative assistant, gentle half-wit nephew Wesley. The teachers have their own flaws, such as a terrible marriage, addictions and excessive, prudish piety.","rating":"5.3","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"5526277689688113104","title":"Halyo Aa Putt Actor Thiyan","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2012","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/12/f9df9864ffb591b85b52c37c224b7c8b.jpg","description":"Hoardes of people migrate to Mumbai daily to make it in the film industry. Lalu (Pradeep Lalwani), an aspiring actor and son of a businessman Hemandas (Ramesh Karnani) is one of them. In Mumbai, Lalu stays at his father's friend Dharamdas' (Naresh Chawla) home where Dharamdas' son Kundan (Jai Hero), a failed actor turned production manager trains him, but Kundan has ulterior motives... Our good old samaritarian who had previously taken a loan from a lady don - Champa (Aarti Jadhwani) to finance a Bhojpuri film has been cheated by the film's producer. He thus sees a scapegaot in Lalu and extracts money from him on the pretext of taking his screen test. Even after finding out that he's being taken for a ride, Lalu does not mind and offers Kundan a big-budget Sindhi movie with a Sindhi unit.","rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"7054762679529259240","title":"Aa Jao Please","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2016","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/12/2bb2768602456ff3f3f060d4cd844bb4.jpg","description":"A Powerful Social Hindi film against witchcraft, superstition, fraudulent tantrik babas jadu tona and black magic in India","rating":"7.6","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"2h 0m","season_count"