much he loves her. Lolyta gets softer and accepts Didis love. \n\nNow Hilman got a Bachelor Degree. At this time he meets Didi who shows her intend to marry Lolyta. \n\nFinally Didi marries Lolyta while Hilman marries Salma. they life so happy at the village. then suddenly Asep appears and changed to become a sissy with Salmas child who has became his child.","rating":"3.0","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"4511231318251946696","title":"AB","type":"series","category":"series","year":"1957","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/09/ffee59c021bd95d705bf7275699f52a6.jpg","description":"Dick Clark hosts a daily to weekly dance show that features the latest hit music for the attending teens to dance to. In addition, the show has performances by popular musicians and audience members rate songs.","rating":"7.5","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"1175031863640051688","title":"The Seed of the Sacred Fig [Hindi]","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2024","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2026/01/26/e8bdbccf01e8982d45a5b4a9082fc1a3-s.jpg","description":"Investigating judge Iman grapples with paranoia amid political unrest in Tehran. When his gun vanishes, he suspects his wife and daughters, imposing draconian measures that strain family ties as societal rules crumble.","rating":"7.5","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"2h 48m","season_count":0,"streams":[{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/d54084846e55fbf1521a9ba1575101a0.mp4?sign=9b4284cb5352caaf90697b240619e305&t=1795686069","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"983243025","season":null,"episode":0},{"quality":"1080p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/45953b5c74faa83a46227ab776afef16.mp4?sign=2771a2cba96f7934150bf3fc8dadf736&t=1795686069","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size