136","season":1,"episode":17},{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/bd59fa5bb7677e25b85f3e10d31dc45e.mp4?sign=5e87800c7caaf8bfdc1d83e2690a0b68&t=1795691725","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"4106843","season":1,"episode":18},{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/2bd2056466061f20376c75847f689d31.mp4?sign=1376ed53c45e5c439ecb11d4ecd9443c&t=1795691725","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"3748184","season":1,"episode":19},{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/3e161c14c9ede90accef0eca6ce796a9.mp4?sign=a62ba2c97426f53970f256df0cad99da&t=1795691725","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"3367498","season":1,"episode":20}],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"8493134170259080016","title":"An Independent Portrait","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2006","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/11/42540f712c06d6c85b349a47adc0386f.jpg","description":"Jose Muniain's An Independent Portrait, documents three days that local artist Felix de la Concha spent painting a portrait of independent filmmaker Robert M Young, exploring the relationship between artist and subject.","rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"5h 0m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"4846377855560862656","title":"An Orphan's Tale","type":"series","category":"series","year":"1981","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/09/dfeaf88da799751ef9bb0ad9c2af4452.jpg","description":"Remi's quiet childhood in chevegnon is interrupted one day as his father comes home after 7 years in Paris, telling him they're not his real parents, and that they can no longer afford to keep him. He is being sold to a travelling circus master, thus starting a journey across lovely French countryside, in the end of which he'll find his biological family, and a few other things.","rating":"8.7","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"4079884110582401984","title":"An International Marriage","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"1916","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/09/6319b32b6124694b07943927dd3f6d8d.jpg","description":"Florence Brent is the daughter of Bennington Brent, who runs a successful laundry business. Florence's childhood friend, John Oglesby, is a Congressman. When Florence visits her friend, Eleanor Williamson, in Washington D.C., she meets Eleanor's fiancé, who is a Count. The Duke of Buritz, a countryman of the Count, tries to corrupt Oglesby for political reasons. Meanwhile, the Count breaks his engagement to Eleanor, having become enamored of Florence. Oglesby eventually exposes the duplicity of the Count and Duke.","rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"5h 0m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"3896891290860013792","title":"Half an Hour","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"1920","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/09/ca8991714f3b06a79013abf0a802b4c2.jpg","description":"In order to help her father, Lord Dartmouth, out of financial difficulties, Lady Lillian agrees to marry the wealthy Richard Garson, whose love she does not reciprocate. After a bitter scene with Richard, Lillian consents to elope with her former suitor, Hugh Paton, leaving her jewels and a letter of explanation behind. Arriving at Paton's rooms, Lillian is told by his maid, Susie, that he is a womanizer. Just then, Dr. George Brodie arrives, carrying the body of Paton who was killed by a taxi. Lillian returns and tries to retrieve her note, but finds the drawer locked. When she appears at dinner, she finds Dr. Brodie, coincidentally invited to dinner by Richard, relating the strange story of that afternoon. Richard speculates on the woman's identity, but the doctor keeps Lillian's secret. Lillian later is able to recover her note and Richard begs her pardon for any suspicions which he had about her. Finally, realizing her husband's love, Lillian confesses all.","rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"5h 0m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"7199154944535347152","title":"Find an Identity","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2023","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/12/e69d08e719d8a28e1ab8be988c43689f.jpg","description":"An exploration of the many difficulties and internal struggles adolescents face during their high school years. Inspired by the Erik H. Erikson's Identity Formation theory, this documentary sits down with students, parents, psychologists, and others to discuss the age-old questions, \"Who am I?\" and \"How do I fit in?\"","rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"7357829880618565880","title":"An Amish Sin","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2022","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2026/01/26/5d3ebb178dd1c61abbd9bf29777d0642.jpg","description":"An Amish teenager tries to escape the harsh 18th-century-style way she grew up to find her own voice and independence.","rating":"6.6","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 25m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[{"subject_id":"8299187855176485680","language":"Indonesian sub","label":"Indonesian sub"}]},{"id":"128781431127559320","title":"An Ordinary Country","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2020","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/10/ee13be74c5e02b8c6e2845252dca0572.jpg","description":"Controlled conversations, recording with hidden cameras, dirty records of interrogations and recruitment attempts as well as video tutorials for the officers of the security service - all of these materials are employed to portray the monitored life in Poland under communism. Sometimes grotesque, this picture is underpinned by horror, escalating intuitively with every minute. The dramatic culmination is when the Big Brother is not just watching but violating the intimacy of an ordinary citizen. Before us, there is a terrifying communist panopticon which keeps spying on and recording itself.","rating":"5.4","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"5h 0m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"2314061066210295760","title":"An Bronntanas","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2014","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/12/a5fd365b09e5650185bf60981f81ff36.jpg","description":"A lifeboat crew discovers millions of euros worth of drugs on a fishing boat off the coast of Ireland.","rating":"7.4","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 53m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"979204472066949352","title":"An Occasional Hell","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2015","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/12/bac0cd098358b569a49a63e934bddcc7.jpg","description":"Cosmic machinations unleash an epic, apocalyptic battle, against an ubiquitous alien menace of unknown origin.","rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"5h 0m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"5706938170370052840","title":"An Unequal Justice","type":"series","category":"series","year":"2023","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/10/74f6c069ce6dda235f626b244384d7b3.jpg","description":null,"rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"344599019445961416","title":"An Innocent Witch","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"1968","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/09/02307fa804ec56afff519c5fd7a722bf.jpg","description":"Oshima Ayako, a young woman in her teens, lives in a small, impoverished fishing village. Her father is too ill to work. As a result, her mother sells her to a nearby brothel. There she qu