.mp4?sign=ed547b9c4ae5ff5d1fc4f255e0c67664&t=1795691746","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"249067473","headers":{"Referer":"https://sportslive.wine","User-Agent":"com.community.oneroom/50020119 (Linux; U; Android 11; en_US; M2007J20CG; Build/RP1A.200720.011; Cronet/135.0.7012.3)"},"season":null,"episode":null},{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/8f382fceed3c77ea6eda4f58607cce3e.mp4?sign=c2611dff4e89586949e251bcd57c67a5&t=1795688015","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"249067473","season":null,"episode":0},{"quality":"720p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/844d4bdcebfd7792f628c58601c09a9a.mp4?sign=4c4165426233ee747f33824c1d04fd61&t=1795688015","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"721177513","season":null,"episode":0}],"episodes":[],"dubs":[{"subject_id":"8316307151899738360","language":"Original Audio","label":"Original Audio"}]},{"id":"2925695827920257680","title":"Ghuspaithiyaa - An Intruder","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2021","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2024/08/12/bf19cbd2f6383270b1486c2f090804f9.jpg","description":"The homeless and destitute often pose as an inconvenience to society, but why don't we part the curtain of our ignorance to see the truth of their pain and reality? This Story is about an unforgotten hero of India. who is living as homeless in present time which becomes the problem for the neighbourhood until he dies and his true identity is revealed and the question stays that can a naked eye see the truth a person beholds. Some time what we see on the roads the people we see starving have create an empathy in us or may be it doesn't sometime, but do we know the reality the person is living in? this is what this story is about that every person, every living soul has a story to tell no matter what what his/her condition is, in what situation the person is living in we can't understand until we understand his/her story.","rating":"6.7","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"8m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"8305642973589554000","title":"Hug an Atheist","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2013","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/12/f13d5fb54707fa2c053d2045adc15bdd.jpg","description":"Hug an Atheist is built around a series of interviews conducted in 2012-2013 and led by Sylvia Broeckx. From its crowd-funded beginning, the film's objective has been to dispel many of the stubborn and long-standing myths and untruths that plague this group of people. A University of Minnesota survey from 2006 showed atheists to be the most distrusted group within the American population, yet whenever someone was pressed to explain their opinion they reached for myths and platitudes. The film tries to illustrate how this group's attitude towards life is really not all that different from most religious people. By interviewing ordinary American atheists, Hug an Atheist takes the viewer on an emotional roller coaster highlighting love, grief, morals, parenting and other life-defining moments and ideas and how and how each is dealt with in a life undefined by a God, religion or afterlife. Apart from these interviews, the filmmakers had unique access to key moments in the lives of some of the protagonists, from a humanist wedding to an atheist Christmas. Scholars and atheist activists provide the broader intellectual and social context in which to place these regular people and their ideas and approaches to life. Is an atheist's morality and sense of good and bad always indebted to the religious context that surrounds them? Is it even possible to define morals and ethics without a 'super-being' or afterlife? Do atheists really wage a war on Christmas? From the academic to the more mundane, Hug an Atheist answers questions that are being asked or should be asked by anyone uninformed or misinformed this growing US minority. The featured atheists span the US geography; filming was conducted from New York to San Francisco, from Harvard to Kentucky, and culminated at the 2013 annual convention of American Atheists in Austin, Texas. These people represent a cross-section of the population, from academics to a comedian, store owners to teachers: American atheists are part of everyday society.","rating":"8.4","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 30m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"7724106787565488616","title":"An American Tail","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"1986","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2026/01/27/401e3704c2cfdd3a01426800f39c86fe.jpg","description":"While emigrating to the United States, a young Russian mouse gets separated from his family and must locate them while trying to survive in a new country.","rating":"6.9","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 20m","season_count":0,"streams":[{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/05bd8c4480acb55674cb3926e9c565b3.mp4?sign=54ad03c9129ed3f282a9664973d254d7&t=1795687060","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"381141873","season":null,"episode":0},{"quality":"720p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/add6df2c89977ea280c8fbb23482627a.mp4?sign=6fe098fe9434bc8ecc14cfc5f4660d9e&t=1795687060","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"721029621","season":null,"episode":0},{"quality":"1080p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/extto/eef9f5a23920ada0f87bec359605b6e0.mp4?sign=0583fc17bd132ab39b2323ab20247c18&t=1795687060","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"1323380233","season":null,"episode":0},{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn4.hakunaymatata.com/resource/05bd8c4480acb55674cb3926e9c565b3.mp4?sign=ea5e4bab2a9257bdd6c9d41f9e1be2fe&t=1795691749","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"381141873","headers":{"Referer":"https://sportslive.wine","User-Agent":"com.community.oneroom/50020119 (Linux; U; Android 11; en_US; M2007J20CG; Build/RP1A.200720.011; Cronet/135.0.7012.3)"},"season":null,"episode