s (in Spanish and English) with Latino talent including J Balvin, Nicky Jam, Residente, Nicki Nicole, C Tangana, Bizarrap, Sech, Snow Tha Product, Cypress Hill, Farina and many more.\n\nBeing at the forefront of the video new media wave, Hard Knock TV has developed into a premier multi-platform video production and entertainment company, focusing on music, culture, sports and lifestyle. With thousands of hours of original programming being produced, aggregated, and distributed worldwide, Hard Knock TV has established itself as the go-to destination for original in-depth entertainment content. Delving into both the mainstream and underground world, Hard Knock TV digs beneath the surface for thought provoking content. Hard Knock's discerning and independent editorial voice, has earned a reputation in the entertainment industry as being the \"Curators of Fresh\".\n\nHard Knock TV lives up to the motto \"Curators of Fresh\" because of their unparalleled track record for being the first to discover emerging trends and talent on the rise to super-stardom. Nick has had the opportunity to interview and expose new artists to a large audience, often before they become household names providing audiences with their first in-depth good look at some of today's brightest talent.","rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"6405641143685897880","title":"A Man Named Scott","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2021","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2026/01/26/60017b12853d716c39c71af7ccb90b53.jpg","description":"Follows the music career of Kid Cudi from the release of 'Day n Nite' in 2008 through present day recordings. Friends and producers illustrate his story in conjunction with concert footage and never before seen behind-the-scenes.","rating":"7.7","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 35m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[{"subject_id":"3