0/6c412dfa4f1c8f10b317f76c9bb8dd61.jpg","description":"This is a story of a young German man, Michel, whose dream is to lead a simple life far from civilization. He lives in the Ukrainian mountains and takes care of endangered animals - water buffaloes. After 10 years of being a loner, Michel falls in love with Vera, a woman from his hometown in Germany, who has two small kids from a previous relationship. Michel moves back to Germany and tries to create a new family with Vera. In the end Michel has to decide - is love worth a broken dream?","rating":"7.6","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 12m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"5056693539233482816","title":"As Smart As They Are: The Author Project","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2005","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/09/be7c534b944dea61b1a94ac759626294.jpg","description":"AS SMART AS THEY ARE: THE AUTHOR PROJECT follows One Ring Zero, a band whose unique sound combines unusual instruments with unorthodox techniques, and documents their collaboration with McSweeney's Publishing and an ensemble cast of award-winning writers. After moving to Brooklyn, One Ring Zero's founding members, Joshua Camp and Michael Hearst, discovered a curious unmarked store that doubled as a makeshift office for McSweeney's, an offbeat publishing company founded by author Dave Eggers. In addition to selling an odd assortment of products ranging from small rubber cubes to lumberjack supplies, the peculiar storefront also served as the venue for weekly literary readings that brought a variety of both burgeoning and established writers to the tiny space. With Camp on accordion and Hearst on claviola, they soon began performing regularly at the events and ultimately invited a handful of authors to contribute lyrics. After receiving contributions from a variety of celebrated writers including Paul Auster, Jonathan Lethem, Rick Moody and Dave Eggers, the duo then faced the challenge of setting this diverse compilation of lyrics to music. Featuring live performances, studio sessions, and interviews with the writers and musicians, AS SMART AS THEY ARE explores the relationships between music and literature while painting a portrait of the literary community that fostered the band.","rating":"8.6","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 3m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"921954001120281936","title":"As Scared As You","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2023","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/12/49ef2f369236bd19c619d9817d5937b4.jpg","description":null,"rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"7076194596937944704","title":"reborn as legend","type":"movie","category":"short_tv","year":"2024","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2026/01/25/22de8c8586d65811273ec6e41ef53560.jpg","description":"Reborn As Billionaire","rating":"7.5","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[{"quality":"720p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/7eeac5d4b7fbba9421d6473cdbd58545.mp4?sign=11d262107c0a6a182d1263906d68c14d&t=1795691961","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"1924144987","season":null,"episode":null},{"quality":"720p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/7eeac5d4b7fbba9421d6473cdbd58545.mp4?sign=11d262107c0a6a182d1263906d68c14d&t=1795691961","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"1924144987","season":1,"episode":1}],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"3834668604994273232","title":"As Quatro Irmãs","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2018","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/13/48fd50fae0aa7d839e5eb1b413403dc8.jpg","description":null,"rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 16m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"7672916586340436928","title":"As Lon