com/image/2026/01/27/d1d3be4bfb48cc37d62b8a2d31b0f264.jpg","description":"A young up and coming artist in New York city has his life and dreams forever altered when the tragic events of 9/11 take the lives of his two best friends and he accepts guardianship of the couple's two young daughters. Now eleven years later, and teaching art at an elementary school, he raises the girls as if they were his own, but the financial grind to live in NYC is too much, so he decides to take the girls away from the only place they've ever called home and move back to Buffalo where he grew up. This \"non-traditional\" family now faced with change, new surroundings, and a new journey, must learn how to adjust to this new life, while trying to find themselves along the way.","rating":"6.2","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 52m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"4563298742924918736","title":"At the Matinée","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2019","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/10/42dde5fa3fda9ce7839a875c2bf8e2d2.jpg","description":"Through Walter Schreifels and his music, a portrait is drawn of a world that existed in New York's Lower East Side during the 80s and has since disappeared.","rating":"7.9","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 25m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"5767638857265086528","title":"Ball at Savoy","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"1937","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/09/ab53025f8ddf88da38a9b29867e7bb5d.jpg","description":"It is the height of the fashionable season and the world-famous singer, Anita Stella, comes to Cannes on the Riviera, where she has been engaged to perform at a Charity Ball sponsored by society leaders. John Egan, a distinguished British diplomat, traveling incognito as Baron Dupont, for reasons of State, falls in love with Stella and resolves to make her acquaintance. Egan/Dupont persuades a waiter, George, at the ball to exchange clothes with him and is brought into proximity with Stella. Meanwhile, Mary, a pretty tap dancer arrives in Cannes, seeks out the supposed Dupont and introduces herself as his long-lost sister. To protect himself, Egan/Dupont is compelled to acknowledge the relationship, but Mary is really an impostor playing a game of her own with her accomplice George the waiter. Later,a diamond necklace is stolen from one of the guests at the ball, and the distinguished British diplomat, who can also tap-dance, finds himself as the primary suspect. This does not bode well with Stella.","rating":"6.8","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 15m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"48956062317297896","title":"Living at 1250","type":"series","category":"series","year":"2016","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/12/1cef07e52c2e52c34cbc514a017e0f64.jpg","description":"Living at 1250 is the story of two strangers living in Los Angeles. They also happen to be actors and have been paired together by their mutual agent to live together due to \"temperamental\" issues that they both have incurred as tenants of previous apartment complexes in the past. Diana, the American actress, is a themed princess for kids' parties by day. Her princess charm can quickly turn evil when things don't go her way. Juan, the Colombian actor, loves to dance. He finds rhythm wherever and whenever it moves him; but when stressed and unchecked, his \"music\" can quickly turn into a raucous. Once Diana and Juan move into their new place, they begin to meet their new apartment villa's colorful neighbors, which also happen to include the villa's owners as well as the landlord: a former child star, who more-often than not, still believes he's a hot shot and loves to retell his glory days to anyone who will listen.","rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"6246991343898741464","title":"Fins at Fifty","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2015","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/11/63b146aa4fb71a6f5cc959296e5a2122.jpg","description":"A five decade look back at the history of the Miami Dolphins captured in interviews with all of the Miami Dolphin legends. The Perfect Season. Dan Marino. The \"clock\" play. Don Shula. The hook and lateral. Larry Csonka. Beating the '85 Bears. The No-Name Defense. The Marks Brothers. The Killer B's. Garo's kick winning the longest playoff game. Paul Warfield, Larry Little and the rest of the Hall of Famers.","rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"4575145705836298192","title":"Breakfast at Sunrise","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"1927","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/13/d8b5e2428d78dd336cae15423d4d008e.jpg","description":"While plotting together to win back their lovers, rich Madeleine and penniless Pierre fall for each other.","rating":"7.0","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 2m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"2297391078900653880","title":"At Death's Door","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"1999","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2026/03/30/28d065667473253f95f1419903ddd34b.jpg","description":"Death is training his son in the art and responsibilities of the family business. His son does well until he's sent out on his own to claim an accident victim. Instead, he's asked by a friend of the dying man to help with CPR. Taken aback, he assents, the dying man is resuscitated, and Death's son is in the doghouse with dad. Enraged, pop gives his son 24 hours to deliver a corpse, so the young man sets out to ice the man who asked him for help earlier that day. Junior's target is a young actor, Tom, going through opening night and loved by Sarah, a rather histrion