ife and Geza are lovers.","rating":"5.7","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 18m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"6601648165286724688","title":"Bastille Live at Eden","type":"series","category":"series","year":"2017","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/10/fba6fd4e7017ed5989b7e1841fa54271.jpg","description":"Earlier this year Bastille performed as part of the 16th year of the Eden Sessions, playing many of their well-known songs including Glory, Good Grief, Icarus and Pompeii to a sold-out arena. The Eden Sessions began in 2002 and are renowned for the stature of the artists they attract and the unique setting of the Eden arena against the backdrop of the biomes.","rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"2011639727270551560","title":"Christmas at Dollywood","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2019","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2026/01/26/04b88cc87e478ba313eb5279ef06e340.jpg","description":"A New York City event planner travels home to Tennessee for the holidays and ends up working on the 30th-anniversary Christmas event at Dollywood alongside the theme park's Director of Operations.","rating":"6.1","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 23m","season_count":0,"streams":[{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/8faadccb80a9ca422a83a98cac87862c.mp4?sign=2b37a8a55b796b28589a5d7ba903c8d9&t=1795687774","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"232514916","season":null,"episode":0},{"quality":"720p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/ceee19bc9225f8ad414a36baf11f0025.mp4?sign=b54dff59ec9e9445874751b6d53034a1&t=1795687774","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"721169385","season":null,"episode":0},{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn4.hakunaymatata.com/resource/8faadccb80a9ca422a83a98cac87862c.mp4?sign=2beb8c765cd9d5405173bd50a7b232fa&t=1795692130","f