takes a former DDR restaurant in the center of Berlin and turns it into a place for techno Parties. They build everything to make it function like a proper club. Since the building has to be demolished in the Summer, they plan just 5 Parties, each one with a theme. From one side the film praises the \"do it yourself\" culture. On the other hand it focuses on the importance to work together for a goal, live the moment and then move towards new horizons.","rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 7m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"152550948374757328","title":"Au nom du fils","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2018","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2026/01/26/dd2341077efe90a006c0983d128875a3.jpg","description":"A film that reveals the behind-the-scenes story of the Hooligana Rugby Club, a rugby club without a sports field, a stadium, or even a dressing room, in Georgia.","rating":"7.1","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"5h 0m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"7097526758362465360","title":"J'ai été au bal","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"1989","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/09/41d2ca784016d04938d5bc6654e2c4cb.jpg","description":"Film on the history of the toe-tapping, foot-stomping music of French Southwest Louisiana.","rating":"7.6","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 24m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"3111000563039749456","title":"Larzac","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2011","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2026/01/27/2036b30af386263d7653c4b34fbb76a7.jpg","description":"Seated in his office in Paris, one day of October 1971, Michel Debré, minister of the Defence declares: We choose the Larzac as it is a deprived land. With no prior dialogue, his decision to extend the military camp of the Larzac is made. The first reaction of the peasants is radical: \"If they want our farms and lands, we'll leave them dead and we won't be the only dead around\" He sets an unanimous wave of protestations and resistances; the beginning of an amazing struggle, that will last for ten years until the elections for Presidency of May 1981","rating":"7.2","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"2h 0m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"2654158979256960080","title":"Duel au village","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2019","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/11/5965f7f739b2d37861cf3c156dfee325.jpg","description":null,"rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"6279822697216493392","title":"Viper in the Fist","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"1971","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2026/01/27/b0d0707b154ed6d746298274714e6603.jpg","description":"3 boys living in the country with a kind grandmother and a sympathetic priest deal with the return of their long absent mother, who clamps down on their antics with ruthlessness, and brings in tougher clergy to implement a harsh regime.","rating":"7.7","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 22m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"1748715276952028496","title":"Retour au Palais","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2018","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/12/fa0fd4836cdd217f915024efc15e575f.jpg","description":"The first time I ever stepped into the Courthouse in Paris, I was twenty. It was already a thousand-years old monument. 6999 doors, 3150 windows, 24 kilometers of corridors, according to the legend. I have been working there for over ten years. I was a court reporter. On the nights when I had to stay late awaiting for a verdict, I would step away from the lights and sink into darker and darker corridors. I would hear rumblings coming from deep down. I had the feeling that the House was alive and it appeared to be moving. It's impending removal hastens my return. I come back to the courthouse with no trial to follow. From its maze of passages and my encounters, from its lurking stories, the portrait of an abstraction emerges piece by piece : justice.","rating":"4.8","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 27m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"159403547220663960","title":"Facing the Void","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2020","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2026/01/26/7b673e9deaa58d62d98355fd061a4e16.jpg","description":"In the collective imagination, mountaineering is seen as an elitist and dangerous activity. When the mainstream press talks about mountaineering, it is generally to relate a drama or an exploit. The mountaineers are then placed in two categories. On the one hand, reckless supermen, engaged in a death struggle with the mountains. On the other, irresponsible unconscious people, that it is too often necessary to get out of a bad patch by mobilizing important means of rescue. But does this negative image of mountaineering match reality ? What if mountaineering had another face, that of a little-known practice, more widespread than one think ? What if mountaineering was not only a matter of supermen, but had also a feminine face ?","rating":"7.9","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"5h 0m","season_count":0,"streams":[{"quality":"360p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/ee087d5a2f0a2ab80a058c0a5bb3d3b7.mp4?sign=7575190681f8541782dab3058b01922e&t=1795692175","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"204935858","season":null,"episode":0},{"quality":"720p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/dc5b5ebb9e9560598e08b49ef9fa8a51.mp4?sign=1dfe7ca6203571c97e50b68b150413d9&t=1795692175","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"713890357","season":null,"episode":0},{"quality":"360p","url":"https://bcdn4.hakunaymatat