uveau » et, niveau 1, tue un général démon et un seigneur démon à mains nues. Pour éviter que les cœurs de démon ne polluent le village, il accepte une mission d'escorte afin d'obtenir une « carte d'invincibilité ». Sans buff, il quitte le village, donne son équipement légendaire à des inconnus, et ses coéquipiers, croyant qu'il est un génie caché, éliminent tous les monstres sur son chemin jusqu'à la capitale. Là, l'antagoniste le provoque devant tous. Bloqué, Fabien est sur le point d'être touché quand le système lui accorde la « Carte d'essai de puissance divine ».","rating":"8.0","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/b2b8afc29fbbfbe56ba89499ea21a387.mp4?sign=156771deee9b5a544d9ed89e892a61ce&t=1795692313","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"42668344","season":1,"episode":1},{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/cdcae92a78e926ccf02aaf265b6df8a9.mp4?sign=5435989695d4ba1912a44586b04459f7&t=1795692313","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"20254954","season":1,"episode":2},{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/22cabe70412be7100285b0134cdd5e6f.mp4?sign=daf505592a593a1537d0cea41efb874c&t=1795692313","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"24936001","season":1,"episode":3},{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/96341fbde610638e8bfddcf5152435b0.mp4?sign=e8763dba48dcea84cf5d3f4d6d60256e&t=1795692313","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"30291991","season":1,"episode":4},{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/a9fdd6de66c509c4c3a8e995ca1afc48.mp4?sign=2fb6cdf6f4281f14e5dc4f5948fec960&t=1795692313","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"12673691","season":1,"episode":5},{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/f4eccfdbb683d6da9dc5cca822632614.mp4?sign=cba75f7b9489db20072283f11fa7a6de&t=1795692313","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"285