g) is being led into risky investments by his capricious mother-in-law; his second daughter Yijun (Jeanette Aw) whom he was proud of returned from abroad without completing her degree; his neglected teenager son and daughter also get into trouble behind his back. In turn, it was Shunfa who helps him resolve his family problems. Unable to take the many setbacks, Wencai collapses and falls sick. He then conceives a scheme with Shunfa to teach his children a lesson.","rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"508689816410807576","title":"الوعد في الصيف","type":"movie","category":"short_tv","year":"2026","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2026/11/26/2a835dd46b150e1ad15bf22ad78198c6.jpg","description":"هان تشي لو، وريث ثري بارد كالجليد يعاني من \"مرض غريب\" — يصاب بالحساسية بمجرد لمس الجنس الآخر — لكنه لا يبدي أي حساسية تجاه أن تشو شيا، سندريلا المجتهدة التي اقتحمت منزله بالصدفة. وبناءً على اقتراح والدة هان، تبدأ قصة حب \"علاجية\" من نوع التربية التدريجية. وفي أثناء محاولتها علاج مرض تشي لو، تكتشف أن تشو شيا شيئاً فشيئاً السر وراء \"مرضه الغريب\"……","rating":"7.1","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/ec875469bc3e93c4942657b25db48aeb.mp4?sign=f064bdf92c307a0d7b1b2d9d07fc2ab7&t=1795692367","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"6679537","season":1,"episode":1},{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/408f1612181c9b40e2b58370150a3aab.mp4?sign=f65ecbcc0df9873b12c0788b4995c2c8&t=1795692367","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"4775695","season":1,"episode":2},{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/cb14864f8e8cc756ca092c85b6c4a5ee.mp4?sign=1b0bdb4c77de73300ff67826b0d00696&t=1795692367","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"4115557","season":1,"episode":3},{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/257