","description":"In the mid '90s, three female high school graduates working in an office take English classes together to earn promotions. Then, they team up to uncover corruption within their company.","rating":"6.6","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 50m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"3179895411880379472","title":"The Defining Moment","type":"series","category":"series","year":"2008","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/10/268b2d3be4b2ac9fd6b120d746bd799f.jpg","description":"Groomed for business by her grandfather since young, Lin Kexin (Fann Wong) is appointed CEO of his conglomerate straight after graduation, with vehement protests from her uncle Tang Weiye (Hou Ren Choo). But Kexin soon finds herself suffering from uncontrollable hysteria, and fears she has inherited her grandmother's mental illness. Weiye took advantage of the situation by forging a medical report to declare her insane and took reins of the business. Convinced of her own illness, the once aggressive and arrogant Kexin slips into a depression and attempted suicide. Her siblings Kexi (Andie Chen) and Keyi (Jeanette Aw), whom she was estrange from, begin to rally around her. With her family's encouragement and love, Kexin recovers and gains not just a new perspective in life. Weiye's mis-management is leading the company into trouble. Will Kexin be able to turn the tide around with the support of her family?","rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"7817513686926770720","title":"X yuansu","type":"series","category":"series","year":"2012","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/12/63004850cf88334d582f92b942879b37.jpg","description":"Zhiqing has a special gift - the ability to see a person for who they really are inside. Together with Jiang Wei, an eccentric private investigator, she faces a series of mysterious events involving alternate dimensions.","rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"8670027397686773752","title":"Till We Meet Again","type":"series","category":"series","year":"2018","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/10/fe173885b3a50962326d6a5e5cd4b98d.jpg","description":"Tripitaka (Elvin Ng), Monkey God (Kingone Wang), Pigsy (Ian Fang) and Sandy (Steven Chiang) met with a calamity while on their journey to the West, due to Flower Fairy Caiyue's (Julie Tan) mistake. Tripitaka, Pigsy and Sandy died as a result of that. Out of despair, Monkey God swore before dying that he will never forgive Caiyue. Unbeknownst to them, the tragedy was orchestrated by the Nine-Tail Vixen (Ann Kok). Out of desperation, Caiyue visited the Goddess of Mercy to beg for a second chance, she was granted 1,000 years to locate the reincarnated Monkey God. Caiyue finally locates him, reincarnated as Zhao Yaojin, at the end of 1,000 years. Caiyue hopes to seek forgiveness and return to the journey to the West. Unfortunately, Yaojin does not have any memory of his past life, neither was he interested in journeying to the west. Faced with the love of her life remembering nothing, how will Caiyue gain the forgiveness she yearns, and will they ever return to complete their journey to the West?","rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"6658822575047034992","title":"Emerald Hill: The Little Nyonya Story","type":"series","category":"series","year":"2025","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2026/01/26/90d69c510efd295841b8b977b9ee1f37.jpg","description":"When a woman learns she is the long-lost daughter of the wealthy Zhang family, her life goes from improvised to full of upper-class drama.","rating":"7.2","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[{"quality":"480p","url":"https://