ay sa pagsagot sa playtime questions.\n\nUmulan naman ng kilig at hiyawan sa studio sa pagpasok ng bagong duo na may hawak ng bowl of questions. Sina Brent Manalo at Ralph de Leon muna ang escorts for today. Para patunayan na deserve nila ang posisyon, daanin sa joke time ang audition.\n\nLaging handa, ‘yan ang motto ng ating mga scout. Kaya sa pagsabak nila sa Laro Laro Pick, walang puwang ang doubt. Boy Scouts of the Philippines ang players for today's video. Ang swerte, sa kanila ba ay sasaludo?\n\nNa-curious si Vice Ganda nang makita ang mga girl sa hanay ng players na bahagi ng Boy Scouts of the Philippines. Sa jackpot round, si Yel ang umabante para sa chance na maiuwi ang P200,000 POT money. Naibigay kaya ni Yel ang tamang sagot at naiuwi ang malaking POT money?\n\n#ShowtimeAmininMo\n#ItsShowtimeFullEpisode \n#ABSCBNEntertainment","rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[{"quality":"360p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/df89b48392c4598d5f9b77c7f1dbc968.mp4?sign=3d5a7288ef05c441dde46986e47b12fe&t=1795692516","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"523577902","season":null,"episode":0},{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/f9ca333403c5c06f06743e21127fd858.mp4?sign=3328bca953f951b1b20b25a33b1de374&t=1795692516","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"923037535","season":null,"episode":0},{"quality":"360p","url":"https://bcdn4.hakunaymatata.com/resource/df89b48392c4598d5f9b77c7f1dbc968.mp4?sign=3d5a7288ef05c441dde46986e47b12fe&t=1795692516","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"523577902","headers":{"Referer":"https://sportslive.wine","User-Agent":"com.community.oneroom/50020119 (Linux; U; Android 11; en_US; M2007J20CG; Build/RP1A.200720.011; Cronet/135.0.7012.3)"},"season":null,"episode":null},{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn4.hakunaymatata.com/resource/f9ca333403c5c06f06743e21127fd858.mp4?sign=3328bca953f951b1b20b25a33b1de374&t=1795692516","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"923037535","headers":{"Referer":"https://sportslive.wine","User-Agent":"com.community.oneroom/50020119 (Linux; U; Android 11; en_US; M2007J20CG; Build/RP1A.200720.011; Cronet/135.0.7012.3)"},"season":null,"episode":null}],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"2115486594227494424","title":"Kung si Darren ang manghaharana, mapapa-OO ka ba?","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2026","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2026/10/29/87b0e0e630d743202cd4e79fa73f12d4.jpg","description":"You and me, magiging happy dahil sa performance ng YUMI, ang girl group mula sa isang teleserye na kinabibilangan nina Zephanie, Olive May, Naya, Gaea and Mitzi. Naki-join din sa kulitan si Bianca Umali. Pero bago ang hosting duties, kumasa muna siya sa “Meme” dance challenge.\n\nSa \"Miss Q and A,\" bawat tanong may kasamang excitement at thrill. Stick to friendly competition lang sina Kim Sumaway, Freda, at Queen Sam Ri. Sisterly bond nila ay tumibay na backstage. Pero huwag malilito, hindi si Freda ang \"kuya\" sa kanilang tatlo!\n\nLaroooo! Sa pagsisimula ng competition, hagalpak sa tawa ang buong nation dahil ang mga kandidata, 1, 2, 3, go, kanya-kanyang hula sa tanong. Ano nga ba talaga ang alyas ni Robert Jaworski sa basketball? Sa hinaba-haba man ng tanungan, na-shoot pa rin ang bola at nakapuntos sina Queen Sam Ri at Freda. Sila ang nag-face-off sa Wit Lang round!\n\nExcuse muna sa classes, dahil sa Laro Laro Pick game arena muna present ang mga classmates nating Psychology student. Ma-ace kaya nila ang challenges at maka-graduate na may POT money?\n\nAgaw-eksena ang charisma ng estudyanteng si Aga, na idol at peg si Brent Manalo. Ay, gwapo! Kahit may itinitibok ang puso, priority niya ang pag-aaral. Ganyan din si player Carms, na feel na feel ang haba ng hair moment niya dahil sa manliligaw. Paano na nga ba magligawan ang Gen Zs? Uso pa ba ang harana? Eh, kung si Darren Espanto ba naman ang manghaharana, mapapa-oo ka talaga!\n\nNabuhayan ang mga bisitang estudyante dahil ang mga naligwak, nabigyan ng pagkakataon na pumakak sa jackpot. Nabunot ang pangalan ni Dayan, na matapang na sinugalan ang POT question.\n\n#ShowtimeOctoBEST\n#ItsShowtimeFullEpisode \n#ABSCBNEntertainment","rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[{"quality":"360p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/8410726e8770cda5ec5ad2239626978e.mp4?sign=025fb64378754ebc48347bab5628e149&t=1795692517","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"530005331","season":null,"episode":0},{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn.hakunaymatata.com/resource/7b023be235ca7d42df74db4288ec2194.mp4?sign=da8eae55cee7623ea3bd0c8fde32f17d&t=1795692517","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"905692316","season":null,"episode":0},{"quality":"360p","url":"https://bcdn4.hakunaymatata.com/resource/8410726e8770cda5ec5ad2239626978e.mp4?sign=025fb64378754ebc48347bab5628e149&t=1795692517","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"530005331","headers":{"Referer":"https://sportslive.wine","User-Agent":"com.community.oneroom/50020119 (Linux; U; Android 11; en_US; M2007J20CG; Build/RP1A.200720.011; Cronet/135.0.7012.3)"},"season":null,"episode":null},{"quality":"480p","url":"https://bcdn4.hakunaymatata.com/resource/7b023be235ca7d42df74db4288ec2194.mp4?sign=da8eae55cee7623ea3bd0c8fde32f17d&t=1795692517","format":"mp4","codec":"h264","size":"905692316","headers":{"Referer":"https://sportslive.wine","User-Agent":"com.community.oneroom/50020119 (Linux; U; Android 11; en_US; M2007J20CG; Build/RP1A.200720.011; Cronet/135.0.7012.3)"},"season":null,"episode":null}],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"3132919052461588432","title":"Be My Lady","type":"series","category":"series","year":"2016","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2026/03/10/2b261a8e68eb2c9954fe32e9c7d61937.jpeg","description":"This is a story of love.after pinangs grandpa gets sick the family sell their land to cater for hospital bill after which mercy \"pinangs mother\" is forced to 