om/image/2023/08/12/cebc8a73810c4ce9cbfe9b8035b12ab9.jpg","description":"An epistolary feature film: a cinematic discourse between a British director, (Mark Cousins, the celebrated film maker and historian) and an Iranian actress and director (Mania Akbari, famed for her work with Abbas Kiarostami and in her own right as a director) which extends the concept of \"essay film\" with startling confrontations in the arenas of cultural issues, gender politics and differing artistic sensibilities. A unique journey into the minds of two exceptional filmmakers which becomes a love affair on film.","rating":"6.4","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 20m","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"1508541255515521256","title":"Free to Be","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2023","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2023/08/12/5f6a03baae5ead2e5f30d1cf10c0388d.jpg","description":null,"rating":null,"director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"","season_count":0,"streams":[],"episodes":[],"dubs":[]},{"id":"4492771617533215568","title":"Be with Me","type":"movie","category":"movies","year":"2005","poster":"https://pbcdn.aoneroom.com/image/2026/03/30/4a7dd2b53edcb689f7e96506241a00b8.jpg","description":"\"Be with Me\" consists of three stories of love vs. solitude : 1) An aging, lonesome shopkeeper doesn't believe in life anymore, ever since his wife died. But he is saved from desperation by reading an autobiographical book and meeting its author, a deaf and blind woman of his own age. 2) Fatty, a security guard in his fifties, lives for two things: good food and love for a pretty executive living in his block of flats. But, if it is easy to satisfy his first need, winning the heart of the distant belle is a horse of another color. 3) Two teenage schoolgirls get to know each other on the Internet. Soon they fall in love.","rating":"7.0","director":null,"cast":null,"genres":null,"duration":"1h 33m","season_count":0,"stream